Install and log in (emacs package should do it):
  curl -fsSL https://omp.sh/install | sh

############################## PLUGINS ##############################
Other useful plugins:
  omp install git:github.com/obra/superpowers
  npm install -g agent-browser
  omp install npm:pi-agent-browser-native
  omp install npm:@ff-labs/pi-fff (install mcp server, update AGENTS.md prompt from README instructions)

Ponytail:
  omp install git:github.com/DietrichGebert/ponytail
  /ponytail [lite | full | ultra | off] 	Set the intensity, or turn it off. No argument reports the current level.
  /ponytail-review                          Review the current diff for over-engineering, hands back a delete-list.
  /ponytail-audit                           Audit the whole repo for over-engineering, not just the diff.
  /ponytail-debt                            Harvest the ponytail: shortcuts you've deferred into a ledger, so "later" doesn't become "never".
  /ponytail-gain                            Show the measured impact scoreboard (less code, less cost, more speed) from the benchmark.
  /ponytail-help                            Quick reference for the commands above.

Account-switcher:
  omp install npm:pi-account-switcher      Install the Account Switcher
  /reload                                  Restart or reload your session
  /account-init                            Initialize the configuration
  /account-add                             Allows you to manually add an API key (instead of OAuth) for an account
  /account-current                         Shows which account you are actively using
  /accounts                                Lists all the configured accounts you've saved


############################## COMMANDS ##############################
Common Commands:
  /fast                    Toggle fast mode
  /review                  Launch interactive code review
  /agents                  Manage bundled task agents
  /init                    Generate AGENTS.md for current codebase
  /advisor                 Toggle advisor
  /compact                 Manual context compaction when a session gets long
  /memory                  Manage memory
  /marketplace             Manage plugins from marketplaces
  /plugins                 Manage plugins
  /reload-plugins          Reload all plugins

Info Commands:
  /model                   Show current model selection
  /stats                   Launch the local stats dashboard
  /session                 Show session information
  /usage                   Show token usage
  /context                 Show context usage

Other Commands:
  /mcp                     Manage MCP servers
                           /mcp reload/list/test
                           /mcp add/remove/disable/enable
  /move                    Move the current session to a different directory
  /rename                  Rename the current session
  /jobs                    Show background jobs
  /export                  Export session to HTML file
  /dump                    Return full transcript as plain text, with LLM request JSON path
  /share                   Share session via an encrypted link (share server or secret gist)
  /browser                 Toggle browser headless vs visible mode
  /todo                    Manage todos
  /changelog               Show changelog
  /tools                   Show available tools
  /ssh                     Manage SSH connections
  /fresh                   Reset provider stream state without changing the local transcript
  /shake                   Shake heavy content out of the conversation context
  /force                   Force next turn to use a specific tool
  /autoresearch            Toggle builtin autoresearch mode, or pass off / clear, or a goal message.
  /green                   Generate a prompt to iterate on CI failures until the branch is green

